  "title": "Cornbread Dressing",
  "description": "Crumbled cornbread, sausage, biscuits, and chopped hard-boiled eggs make up this delicious dressing or stuffing. It makes enough to stuff a 10- to 15-pound turkey.",
  "authors": [
    "Beth Dillard"
  ],
